id: pm-rzs24j
title: "Official MCP tasks extension for pm: asynchronous long operations, tasks/get polling, tasks/update input, durable handles, and lifecycle convergence"
description: "Expose long-running pm operations through io.modelcontextprotocol/tasks with SDK-owned durable handles, polling, mid-flight input, cancellation, expiration, and immutable lifecycle evidence."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: "area:mcp","area:sdk",async,durable-handles,long-running,tasks-extension
created_at: "2026-08-25T05:09:28.783Z"
