  "2026-08-25T17:55:11.973Z","harness:codex","Final evidence 2026-08-25: the public durable task store and MCP adapter implement the negotiated io.modelcontextprotocol/tasks extension with create/get/update/cancel, principal isolation, TTL expiry, restart recovery, atomic writes, immutable terminal results, MRTR mid-flight input, and explicit non-support for list and blocking result methods. PM-linked 21-test cohort passed; the same exact 7,950-test 100/100/100/100 repository run plus static, graph, package, plugin-host, temporary-consumer, security, and dependency gates passed."
  "2026-08-25T18:05:13.731Z","harness:codex","Evidence addendum: detached MCP task execution now settles persistence-layer rejections at the background boundary so a durable-store failure cannot become a process-level unhandled rejection; focused branch-residual suite passed 9/9, typecheck passed, and the full lint/static assurance chain passed with graph-composition and 54,339-event append-only record integrity green."
